  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "스페셜 서치가 거의 다 완성됐어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58AC000020AC70C7580020B2E40020C644C131B410C5B4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스페셜이요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D398C15CC774C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "서치요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C11CCE58C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 미르가 여전히 출현하고 있잖아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974AC000020C5ECC804D7880020CD9CD604D558ACE00020C788C796C544002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개중에는 여태껏 본 적 없는\n미지의 이차원 미르도 존재한다는 모양이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CC911C5D0B2940020C5ECD0DCAECF0020BCF80020C8010020C5C6B294000ABBF8C9C0C7580020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974B3C40020C874C7ACD55CB2E4B2940020BAA8C591C774C57C002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 미지의 이차원 미르를\n발견하기 위한 시스템이 바로...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>스페셜 서치<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>라는 거지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020BBF8C9C0C7580020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974B97C000ABC1CACACD558AE300020C704D55C0020C2DCC2A4D15CC7740020BC14B85C002E002E002E00100001BE01000A00100002FF000006C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE5800100002FF000000B77CB2940020AC70C9C0002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 업적인 것처럼 이야기했지만,\n개발한 건 퀘이사 주식회사니까 오해 말라고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C5C5C801C7780020AC83CC98B7FC0020C774C57CAE30D588C9C0B9CC002C000AAC1CBC1CD55C0020AC740020D018C774C0AC0020C8FCC2DDD68CC0ACB2C8AE4C0020C624D5740020B9D0B77CACE0002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스페셜 서치가 완성되면\n미지의 이차원 미르와 연결된<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n특별한 이차원의 뒤틀림을 찾을 수 있을 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58AC000020C644C131B418BA74000ABBF8C9C0C7580020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C6400020C5F0ACB0B41C00100001BE00000AD2B9BCC4D55C0020C774CC28C6D0C7580020B4A4D2C0B9BCC7440020CC3EC7440020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C57C002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "완성시키기 위해서는\n이차원 조사가 필요하다고 하니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n열심히 이차원 태스크를 클리어해 보라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C644C131C2DCD0A4AE300020C704D574C11CB294000AC774CC28C6D00020C870C0ACAC000020D544C694D558B2E4ACE00020D558B2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AC5F4C2ECD7880020C774CC28C6D00020D0DCC2A4D06CB97C0020D074B9ACC5B4D5740020BCF4B77CACE0002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스페셜 서치를 완성시키기 위해\n열심히 이차원 태스크를 클리어해 보라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58B97C0020C644C131C2DCD0A4AE300020C704D574000AC5F4C2ECD7880020C774CC28C6D00020D0DCC2A4D06CB97C0020D074B9ACC5B4D5740020BCF4B77CACE0002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수고 많으십니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218ACE00020B9CEC73CC2EDB2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 님께서 의뢰하신 건을\n훌륭히 완수해 주셨군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020B2D8AED8C11C0020C758B8B0D558C2E00020AC74C744000AD6CCB96DD7880020C644C218D5740020C8FCC168AD70C694002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 님의 방으로\n와 주시면 감사하겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020B2D8C7580020BC29C73CB85C000AC6400020C8FCC2DCBA740020AC10C0ACD558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수고 많았어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218ACE00020B9CEC558C5B4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수집한 데이터를\n시스템에 입력하면...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218C9D1D55C0020B370C774D130B97C000AC2DCC2A4D15CC5D00020C785B825D558BA74002E002E002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "됐다!\n이걸로 스페셜 서치가 완성된 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B410B2E40021000AC774AC78B85C0020C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58AC000020C644C131B41C0020AC70C57C002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특별한 이차원의 뒤틀림을\n서치할 수 있어서 스페셜 서치란 말씀!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9BCC4D55C0020C774CC28C6D0C7580020B4A4D2C0B9BCC744000AC11CCE58D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C11C0020C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58B7800020B9D0C500002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스페셜 서치를 실행하실 거라면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58B97C0020C2E4D589D558C2E40020AC70B77CBA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아주 잘했어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C8FC0020C798D588C5B4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스페셜 서치로만 발견할 수 있는\n이차원 미르에는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n특별한 포켓몬이 있을 가능성이 높다고 해.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58B85CB9CC0020BC1CACACD5600020C2180020C788B294000AC774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C5D0B29400100001BE00000AD2B9BCC4D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C788C7440020AC00B2A5C131C7740020B192B2E4ACE00020D574002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대신, 스페셜 서치를 사용하려면\n매번 데이터를 새로 모아야 하지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300C2E0002C0020C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58B97C0020C0ACC6A9D558B824BA74000AB9E4BC880020B370C774D130B97C0020C0C8B85C0020BAA8C544C57C0020D558C9C0002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금 힘들겠지만\n너라면 문제없을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE080020D798B4E4ACA0C9C0B9CC000AB108B77CBA740020BB38C81CC5C6C7440020AC70C57C002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스페셜 서치를 실행하려면\n이차원 조사 포인트가 필요합니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D398C15C0020C11CCE58B97C0020C2E4D589D558B824BA74000AC774CC28C6D00020C870C0AC0020D3ECC778D2B8AC000020D544C694D569B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바가 부르고 있다...\n녹청파 사무소로 가자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
